# Pico SDK platform

The SDK definitions, boards, vendored library, bridge, and wrapper that make up
the Pico SDK-backed platform. The branch is non-core with a lock: the wrapper
names a third-party library, and a core node may not. rp2040-ram and rp2350-ram
stay outside this directory because they are project-linked core platforms that
do not depend on Pico SDK.
